    <!-- shortcuts -->
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.title">SHORTCUTS</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.lock">Lock / unlock the overlay. While locked it can't be clicked and clicks go through to the game (leave it like this while playing). Unlock it to change settings or drag it.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.toggle">Show / hide the overlay, e.g. to clear the screen mid-raid.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.wheel">Ctrl + mouse wheel</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.wheel.desc">With the mouse over the overlay: make it bigger / smaller (60–200 %). The overlay must be unlocked.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.drag">Drag the header</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.drag.desc">Move the overlay anywhere on the screen. The overlay must be unlocked.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="s.keys.note">Shortcuts work while the game is running and the app is in the background. To change the keys, edit clickThroughHotkey / toggleOverlayHotkey / fleaSearchHotkey in the profile's settings.json (e.g. "Ctrl+Alt+F9"). If a shortcut clashes with another program, the app warns you at start.</sys:String>
